      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道以来，持续稳定拿下难度比赛\n斩获『皐月赏』桂冠的比萨胜驹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea35c50b7669780e4748662e5550cc4810e188c8496c8e8408c738886ffd617c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
