    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b51c62f9e3a4d3c55f7902",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后是统治地位！　她虽然遗憾错过『皐月赏』，\n但漂亮地赢下前哨战，拿到了\n『日本德比』的入场券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "409fcf1958565c62e77edc9d5e03dd9a4d7c681858b000e77acdebb1aceddea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
