    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79421417acefd1c6082362b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "载入史册的一战即将开始……\n已经能从观众席上感受到热切的期待了――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "516b1e4846fc5eb8544970acde27c7f0a8efe0a59a1e9e922a9d53ef9e83e769",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02165f9078656f582dd96834",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强敌迷人景致，\n与她一战的『日本杯』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca9b71971732fe907449045c53dd27ab7497505e51e8c56c1b93b6618ef20d7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0059f324e43ca2b986c9dd6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后一圈！……呜、加油、比萨！",
