      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不坏，但还有打磨的余地。\n在『日本杯』位置感至关重要。\n我们彻底地练一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4015af0d5fa0b8df8f11be5f43f1326dfa64cbc54229f61bc14b2d879bfebe37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
